                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Communicate the primary benefits customers receive from the product.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Highlight meaningful product capabilities that competitors cannot easily replicate.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Connect product features with measurable customer outcomes.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Use clear and customer-focused language instead of unnecessary technical terminology.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Validate the value proposition using customer feedback and market research.</p>
                    </li>
